// type OrderStatus = "pending" | "processing" | "delivered" | "cancelled"`},{id:"ch08-b22",kind:"code",title:"\u0643\u0648\u062F \u062A\u0648\u0636\u064A\u062D\u064A (text)",text:`\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0639\u064A\u0627\u0631                       Enum                     Union of Literals     Object as const
